Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Favorite Green Grass Cake
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 34
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.38,0:12:36.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.59,0:00:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The annual Flower Baby selection event is about to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.79,0:00:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We welcome all the Flower Mentors and Mud Mentors here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.06,0:00:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,As always, the Flower Babies will take the stage to show off their talents.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.98,0:00:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If a Flower Mentor or Mud Mentor sees a Flower Baby they like,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.32,0:00:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,remember to press the selection button.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.64,0:00:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,So, all I have to do is press a button? That sounds pretty simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.91,0:00:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, let’s invite the first Flower Baby to the stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.42,0:00:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, everyone. My name is Jiajia.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.78,0:00:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,My talent is dancing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.90,0:01:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Jiajia’s dance moves are incredibly dynamic and exceptionally elegant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.78,0:01:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe she can awaken the Dazzling Dance Flower Spark and become a dancer flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.90,0:01:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,So, are the mentors who wish to choose Jiajia ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.75,0:01:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.58,0:01:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Friendly reminder:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.51,0:01:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The more times you press the button, the brighter the lantern shines.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.67,0:01:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Within the allotted time,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.51,0:01:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,only the mentor with the brightest lantern gets to choose the Flower Baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.00,0:01:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn’t you say so earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.64,0:01:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.01,0:01:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations to Kui Huahua for choosing Jiajia.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.51,0:01:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s up with these flowers? They are so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.32,0:01:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,No worries, we still have plenty of amazing Flower Babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.72,0:01:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s welcome the next one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.12,0:01:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,—An all-around math genius, —I want!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.67,0:01:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,—Shushu. —I want, I want!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.79,0:01:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The little skateboarding prince, A Fei.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.60,0:01:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The boxing kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.76,0:02:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiao Gui.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.35,0:02:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I want, I want, I want!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.39,0:02:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn’t snag a single one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.87,0:02:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,So, let’s welcome the next one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.81,0:02:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello everyone, my name is Zhuangzhuang.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.40,0:02:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This Flower Baby is powerfully built; he might awaken the Giant Strength Sunflower Spark in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.40,0:02:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,He might even awaken the Light Cotton Spark, just like Xi Huahua.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.88,0:02:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Light Cotton is the strongest Spark in our tribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.92,0:02:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That means
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.76,0:02:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,he could become an outstanding flower, just like Xi Huahua.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.20,0:02:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,So Xi Huahua is actually that amazing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.90,0:02:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s a shame that only Xi Huahua and the other one can have him right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.81,0:02:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m definitely going to pick this Flower Baby this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.09,0:02:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,In your dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.09,0:02:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Take your positions.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.92,0:02:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.66,0:02:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Mei Huahua.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.54,0:02:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,With him, I’ll definitely be the first to enter the Trial Grounds and get the fragment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.93,0:02:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m the only one left without one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.13,0:03:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Xi Huahua, don’t lose heart. We still have one final, special Flower Baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.65,0:03:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What? There’s still a special one?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.00,0:03:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.72,0:03:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally have a Flower Baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.47,0:03:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.45,0:03:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Today’s Flower Baby selection has concluded successfully.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.09,0:03:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.72,0:03:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s wrong with everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.55,0:03:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,He looks just like Paddi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.61,0:03:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll go first! I’ll go first!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.29,0:03:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.60,0:03:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, one at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.20,0:03:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You go first.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.32,0:03:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Paddi, I’m in trouble…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.20,0:03:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve gained weight. What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.04,0:03:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you have to fight fire with fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.27,0:04:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I suddenly don’t want to lose weight anymore. Let’s dig in together.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.88,0:04:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,With the right mindset, everything falls into place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.64,0:04:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Next.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.28,0:04:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I was trying to cook by the river today and discovered my rice cooker wouldn’t work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.91,0:04:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Paddi, what should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.99,0:04:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you probably need this:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.14,0:04:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,A self-charging rice cooker.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.22,0:04:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, there’s no electricity by the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.89,0:04:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I use a rice cooker?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.65,0:04:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Paddi, you’re so smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.81,0:04:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I never thought being the village chief would be so easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.81,0:04:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.62,0:04:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What if that monster comes to Goats’ Village again to steal the fragment?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.93,0:04:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think we should do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.10,0:04:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.86,0:04:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What is a mentor supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.34,0:04:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I never expected Xi Huahua to become Lan Baobao’s mentor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.61,0:04:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That Lan Baobao is notorious for being the laziest Flower Baby of all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.73,0:04:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Gluttonous, lazy, and disobedient.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.41,0:04:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,He’s already driven away many mentors.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.85,0:04:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever teaches him is out of luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.00,0:05:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But Xi Huahua is also our best mentor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.29,0:05:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve been looking at his “Flower Notes”.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.85,0:05:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The teaching plan outlined in there is excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.01,0:05:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,As expected of Xi Huahua.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.80,0:05:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That notes you were just talking about…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.00,0:05:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Could I have a look at it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.42,0:05:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The Flower Mentor and the Flower Baby must complete a trial mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.45,0:05:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,First, they must establish a relationship of trust between mentor and student.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.74,0:05:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,A relationship of trust?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.21,0:05:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to wake up, Lan Baobao.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.26,0:05:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.81,0:05:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Sleeping so soundly—just like Paddi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.93,0:05:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If he’s like Paddi, maybe there’s a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.29,0:05:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,If Weslie is here, What would he do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.46,0:06:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, I need to think like Weslie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.21,0:06:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Fast asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.32,0:06:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve got an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.48,0:06:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knew sleeping was actually my way of thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.33,0:06:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,So is this the method Paddi mentioned?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.21,0:06:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t know; let’s just trust Paddi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.29,0:06:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.12,0:06:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are there so many mushrooms?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.88,0:06:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Paddi, it’s not mushroom season right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.92,0:06:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m not gathering them to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.79,0:06:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,They serve a very important purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.89,0:06:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Spicy Mushroom; it tastes numbing and hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.85,0:06:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Bouncy Mushroom; it has a super springy texture.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.60,0:06:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Hug Mushroom; its cap is huge and delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.25,0:06:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But everything you’ve described is just about their texture.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.24,0:07:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Paddi is the only one left guarding the fragment in Green Green Grassland.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.28,0:07:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I’ve won this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.86,0:07:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We won’t let you get away with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.70,0:07:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though Paddi is usually lazy, gluttonous,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.54,0:07:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,slapdash, and timid,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.21,0:07:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,he is absolutely trustworthy when it counts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.34,0:07:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s hard to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.02,0:07:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Just wait and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.09,0:07:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.53,0:07:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The monsters are coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.12,0:07:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t panic, everyone; have faith in my mushroom formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.20,0:08:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s happening? I’ve never seen a trap like this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.00,0:08:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Paddi, you’re amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.32,0:08:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you could do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.54,0:08:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.85,0:08:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Paddi, you’re amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.81,0:08:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I had no idea these mushrooms were so powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.73,0:08:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Paddi, how did you discover them?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.41,0:08:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s not talk about the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.00,0:08:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I can’t tell them I tried them all out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.00,0:08:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We won a great victory; let’s celebrate together,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.52,0:08:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,and have some delicious grass cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.63,0:08:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.84,0:08:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me prepare it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.72,0:08:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is the Mentor? Did he get angry and leave too?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.47,0:08:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Must be.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.51,0:08:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He only knows how to sleep; how could he possibly become a flower?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.49,0:08:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,There are flowers that love to sing. There are flowers that love to dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.44,0:08:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,There are flowers that love to paint. And naturally, there are also flowers that love to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.40,0:09:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Lan Baobao, I made a grass cake that you’ve never tasted before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.52,0:09:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It smells so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.23,0:09:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.79,0:09:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,This creamy grass cake fills me with energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.64,0:09:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.28,0:09:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.00,0:09:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, keeping my wings out like this
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.62,0:09:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,uses up too much energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.09,0:09:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, you look really hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.41,0:09:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s eat together.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.85,0:09:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.62,0:09:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Does the fact that you’re willing to share the cake with me
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.46,0:09:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,mean that we’ve established a bond of trust?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.14,0:09:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know why I shared the cake with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.90,0:09:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Wasn’t it because of the cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.02,0:09:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,There are flowers that love to sing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.82,0:09:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There are flowers that love to dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.54,0:09:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,There are flowers that love to paint.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.22,0:10:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And naturally, there are also flowers that love to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.11,0:10:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,No one has ever spoken well of me before, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.63,0:10:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,So, we’ve established a bond of trust?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.43,0:10:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You’ve passed my first test.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.74,0:10:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The first test?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.51,0:10:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It all depends on how you perform in the next test.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.79,0:10:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to give it your all
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.95,0:10:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Who’s the mentor now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.82,0:10:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m going to dig in
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.46,0:10:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Dig in
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.95,0:10:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Paddi, what’s wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.91,0:10:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Did we not make the cake well?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.75,0:10:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.35,0:10:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Paddi, the cake you made is amazing
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.42,0:10:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope we can always be happy together
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.54,0:10:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it’s just…I was thinking about Sparky and the others
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.48,0:10:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder how they’re doing over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.07,0:10:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s easy; we can just communicate via the drones following them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.67,0:11:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is the signal gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.51,0:11:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.72,0:11:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,There are two more intruders.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.22,0:11:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Retract.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.46,0:11:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Their mission is to rescue Mr. Slowy, and mine is to stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.26,0:11:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Overestimating yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.65,0:11:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,So? Is there a signal yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.80,0:11:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The drones are likely destroyed; I can’t see the playback.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.90,0:11:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t know if they’ve run into any danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.22,0:11:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to go help them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.42,0:11:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.89,0:11:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You go ahead; we’ve got things covered here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.81,0:12:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,With the mushroom formation you set up, we’ll definitely be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.22,0:12:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.46,0:12:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.49,0:12:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We are also Mighty Little Defenders.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.41,0:12:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll leave this place in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.11,0:12:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, wait for me.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
